  6. Observation Construction                                                                                                                            

  [FIXED — assertion added] 6.1 — obs_dim = len(obs_keys) + 2 coupling was unguarded
  - Added a direct assertion comment. The +2 is now clearly documented as transition_ticks_norm and delta_in_flight_norm.                                
                                                                                                                                                         
  [NOT FIXED] 6.2 — ObservationNorm reduces mean/std across all edges into one vector                                                                    
  - reduce_dim=(0, 1) in train_lstm.py merges all edges. For the current single-edge config this is fine. Multi-edge normalization would require per-edge stats.
                                                                                                                                                         
